  <string name="coherence_guidance_regulation">Breathe slowly. Let your body ease its pace and find stability.</string>
  <string name="coherence_guidance_heart">Bring your attention to the center of your chest. Imagine the breath flowing in and out through your heart.</string>
  <string name="coherence_guidance_gratitude">Recall a simple memory that brings genuine gratitude. Let the feeling grow in your chest.</string>
  <string name="coherence_guidance_love">Think of someone, somewhere, or a moment that awakens love. Breathe into that feeling.</string>
  <string name="coherence_guidance_peace">Picture a peaceful scene. Let peace become a physical sensation.</string>
  <string name="coherence_guidance_joy">Recall a moment of pure joy. Smile gently and let your body recognize it.</string>
  <string name="coherence_guidance_integration">Remain in silence. Anchor this coherence and let your intention become a felt experience.</string>
  <string name="coherence_attention_jaw">Relax your jaw. Let your tongue rest and allow your face to soften.</string>
  <string name="coherence_attention_shoulders">Lower your shoulders. Release any unnecessary effort in your neck and back.</string>
  <string name="coherence_attention_weight">Feel the weight of your body. Let the support beneath you hold you.</string>
  <string name="coherence_attention_chest">Notice your chest and sternum. Bring calm, effortless attention there.</string>
  <string name="coherence_attention_abdomen">Soften your abdomen. Let your breath become spacious, slow, and comfortable.</string>
