  <string-array name="coherence_welcome_phrases">
    <item>Coherence is the secret language\nbetween your heart and mind</item>
    <item>Everything you need\nalready lives within you</item>
    <item>Enter your sacred space and let the magic unfold</item>
    <item>When you enter coherence,\nyour biology remembers its wholeness</item>
    <item>Today you choose to elevate your state\nand transform your reality</item>
    <item>Let the mystery surround you\nand reveal its truth</item>
    <item>Your heart knows the way;\nyour mind learns to follow</item>
    <item>You are more powerful than you remember</item>
    <item>Breathe and cross the threshold\nwhere your essence is revealed</item>
    <item>Here begins the alignment\nbetween what you feel and who you are</item>
    <item>Every heartbeat is a doorway\nto your natural balance</item>
    <item>You are remembering who you are\nbeyond thought</item>
    <item>Your heart knows the way\nto your state of wholeness</item><item>Surrender to your inner rhythm\nand let it guide you</item><item>When heart and mind meet,\na new state of being emerges</item>
    <item>Today you create from coherence,\nnot from reaction</item><item>Trust what emerges\nwithout needing to understand it</item><item>Your heart sets the rhythm\nof your deepest truth</item>
    <item>Today you choose to respond from calm,\nnot from impulse</item><item>Let that calm\nbecome clarity</item><item>Your energy responds\nto what you feel now</item>
    <item>Today you choose elevation,\nopenness, and possibility</item><item>Let that frequency\nshape your reality</item><item>In this moment,\neverything reorganizes in your favor</item>
    <item>You are the observer and creator\nof your experience</item><item>Allow transformation\nto unfold without resistance</item><item>Let the magic happen</item>
  </string-array>
