  <string name="presence_info_body">This practice combines two gestures: waking up from autopilot and embodying your desired state now. Every tap gently interrupts an old habit and deliberately chooses an identity.</string>
  <string name="presence_suggestion_no_data">There are not enough records in this range yet. Make one or two conscious returns today to begin revealing a useful pattern.</string>
  <string name="presence_suggestion_few_days">Only a few days have records. Try a brief pause in mid-morning and another late in the afternoon to begin revealing your pattern.</string>
  <string name="presence_suggestion_no_presence">Only autopilot moments appear so far. Choose an easy time, such as before lunch, to record a deliberate conscious return.</string>
  <string name="presence_suggestion_window">Autopilot is concentrated between %1$s and %2$s. Try a 30-second pause just before that window.</string>
  <string name="presence_suggestion_more_autopilot">There is more autopilot than presence in this range. Choose one daily transition as a cue to return to your body.</string>
  <string name="presence_suggestion_no_autopilot">This range shows presence without any recorded autopilot moments. Add moments of distraction too for more accurate suggestions.</string>
  <string name="presence_suggestion_balanced">Your records are fairly balanced. Choose a specific time of day and repeat a mindful pause there until it becomes a habit.</string>
